{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113881","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113881/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113881/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113881/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113881","id":3718102683,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7dnb6b","number":113881,"title":"Quaternion(Vector3 arcFrom, Vector3 arcTo) may have a little mistake in Godot 4.5.1 mono","user":{"login":"Supheria","id":77865986,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3ODY1OTg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77865986?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Supheria","html_url":"https://github.com/Supheria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Supheria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Supheria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Supheria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Supheria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Supheria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Supheria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Supheria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Supheria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Supheria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-12-11T07:09:36Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T12:23:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducibe in Godot 4.5.1 mono\n- Not Reproducibe in Godot 4.4.1 mono\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 Godot mono\n\n### Issue description\n\nBackground: A Quaternion created from axis vector (arcFrom) and direction vector (arcTo) , by Quaternion(Vector3 arcFrom, Vector3 arcTo) , measures rotation alone the y-axis.\n\nLogically, the rotation of the axis vector (arcFrom) as Vector3.Right and as Vector3.Forward should be “symmetrical“. However an exception occurs in Vector3.Right condition.\n\nHere are data of testing Quaternion(Vector3 arcFrom, Vector3 arcTo) :\n\n<img width=\"1372\" height=\"664\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c662e36e-ff79-4d40-9948-c9d2f3693de9\" />\n\n<img width=\"1372\" height=\"663\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c6e7e2b-990b-4b0b-b688-b1f78d294d9f\" />\n\nSee more directly by using meshes:\n\n> axis vector (arcFrom) as Vector3.Right:\n> \n> <img width=\"652\" height=\"622\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/054cd0bf-e5c2-45b3-9a95-2c72dd967731\" />\n> \n> <img width=\"748\" height=\"748\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06acb212-b632-490c-ae36-6889265f3394\" />\n\n> axis vector (arcFrom) as Vector3.Forward:\n>\n> <img width=\"680\" height=\"613\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/39042acd-6007-49ba-8373-d574ff4c46fa\" />\n> \n> <img width=\"706\" height=\"750\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ead7c4b3-7655-44b9-9f17-5dfce492ca20\" />\n\nHowever, **the same problem won't happen in Godot 4.4.1 mono**.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nC# codes of the test are like:\n\n``` c#\nvar direction = new Vector(0f, 0f, -1f).Normalized();\nvar quaternion = new Quaternion(Vector3.Right, direction); // also use Vector3.Forward\nvar euler = quaternion.GetEuler();\n... // print result\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI'll try to create one if necessary.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113881/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}